  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "{\"label\":\"p0\",\"action\":\"get_page_content\",\"result\":{\"pageId\":\"68974c57cac027f80fdf8828\",\"nodes\":[{\"type\":\"component-instance\",\"id\":\"5daa0d89-1525-0b1e-d586-5451f22a0da1\",\"componentId\":\"6eacd627-99de-2c44-908f-4b2e4f06c29b\",\"propertyOverrides\":[]},{\"type\":\"html-embed\",\"id\":\"9b489140-f779-43cd-cc2d-c3d82956e2d8\",\"html\":\"<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68974c57cac027f80fdf883f/6afef72e3bf511e913abd6f5_kd-site-17.css\\\">\",\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889ad\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Built by real estate investors. For real estate investors.</p>\",\"text\":\"Built by real estate investors. For real estate investors.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889b1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h1>Your real estate business. <em class=\\\"gear-text\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889b0\\\">In a higher gear.</em></h1>\",\"text\":\"Your real estate business. In a higher gear.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889b3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">KPI DRIVER is the command center for real estate investors and their teams. One CRM runs your pipelines from first lead to rental, KPI tracking shows where the business stands, and access to the AI Suite comes included.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER is the command center for real estate investors and their teams. One CRM runs your pipelines from first lead to rental, KPI tracking shows where the business stands, and access to the AI Suite comes included.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889b5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://link.kpidriver.com/widget/booking/9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\\\">Book a Discovery Call</a>\",\"text\":\"Book a Discovery Call\"},\"attributes\":{\"data-label\":\"hero\",\"data-event\":\"discovery_call_click\",\"data-book\":\"9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\",\"rel\":\"noopener\",\"href\":\"https://link.kpidriver.com/widget/booking/9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be889b7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--ghost\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa6c72b8bbfbdd8948a38f\\\">Explore the AI Suite</a>\",\"text\":\"Explore the AI Suite\"},\"attributes\":{\"data-label\":\"hero ai suite\",\"data-event\":\"product_explore\",\"href\":\"/services/ai-suite\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a12\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"cc__bar\\\"><span class=\\\"cc__title\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a0f\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a0d\\\"></div>AI Suite · Notes Taker</span><span class=\\\"badge badge--included\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a11\\\">Live</span></div>\",\"text\":\"AI Suite · Notes TakerLive\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a14\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"transcript__say\\\">“We inherited it last spring. Roof needs work. Around two-ten if it is quick.”</p>\",\"text\":\"“We inherited it last spring. Roof needs work. Around two-ten if it is quick.”\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a1b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a18\\\">Situation</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a1a\\\">Inherited</span></div>\",\"text\":\"SituationInherited\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a20\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a1d\\\">Condition</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a1f\\\">Roof repair</span></div>\",\"text\":\"ConditionRoof repair\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a25\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a22\\\">Asking</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a24\\\">$210,000</span></div>\",\"text\":\"Asking$210,000\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a38\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"cc__agent-ch\\\"><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a30\\\">Voice</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a32\\\">SMS</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a34\\\">Email</span><span data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a37\\\"><span class=\\\"keep-case\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a36\\\">iMessage</span></span></div>\",\"text\":\"VoiceSMSEmailiMessage\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a3e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"cc__caption\\\"><span class=\\\"note\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a3b\\\">Illustrative preview · sample data</span><span class=\\\"note\\\" data-w-id=\\\"36385b32-148d-b091-ee2b-e1ca6be88a3d\\\">Not an actual product screen</span></p>\",\"text\":\"Illustrative preview · sample dataNot an actual product screen\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fa6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2 id=\\\"does-h\\\" class=\\\"sr-only\\\">What KPI DRIVER does</h2>\",\"text\":\"What KPI DRIVER does\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fa8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Run the business</p>\",\"text\":\"Run the business\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27faa\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Keep operations and teams connected</h3>\",\"text\":\"Keep operations and teams connected\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fac\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Acquisitions, dispositions, transaction coordination, vendors and rentals each run on their own pipeline inside one system.</p>\",\"text\":\"Acquisitions, dispositions, transaction coordination, vendors and rentals each run on their own pipeline inside one system.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27faf\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">See the whole picture</p>\",\"text\":\"See the whole picture\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fb1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Know what is working and what is stuck</h3>\",\"text\":\"Know what is working and what is stuck\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fb3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">KPI tracking across every pipeline shows performance, opportunities and bottlenecks without a spreadsheet rebuild.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI tracking across every pipeline shows performance, opportunities and bottlenecks without a spreadsheet rebuild.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fb6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Accelerate with intelligence</p>\",\"text\":\"Accelerate with intelligence\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fb8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Put AI on specific jobs</h3>\",\"text\":\"Put AI on specific jobs\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"8a381731-bd7c-086b-ccfe-5621f4d27fba\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use AI tools for call notes, coaching, underwriting, contact data and forecasting when a task calls for them.</p>\",\"text\":\"Use AI tools for call notes, coaching, underwriting, contact data and forecasting when a task calls for them.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1d30\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">A connected operation</p>\",\"text\":\"A connected operation\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1d32\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>Most CRMs stop at the lead. Your business does not.</h2>\",\"text\":\"Most CRMs stop at the lead. Your business does not.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1d34\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">KPI DRIVER follows a deal through every team that touches it. Pick a stage to see what happens there and where the work goes next.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER follows a deal through every team that touches it. Pick a stage to see what happens there and where the work goes next.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dbd\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Capture</p>\",\"text\":\"Capture\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dbf\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Every lead lands in one place</h3>\",\"text\":\"Every lead lands in one place\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dc1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Leads from web forms, PPC campaigns, inbound calls, SMS, email and social arrive in a single acquisitions pipeline, so nothing lives in a spreadsheet or someone's inbox.</p>\",\"text\":\"Leads from web forms, PPC campaigns, inbound calls, SMS, email and social arrive in a single acquisitions pipeline, so nothing lives in a spreadsheet or someone's inbox.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dc3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>See every new lead in one organized view</li>\",\"text\":\"See every new lead in one organized view\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dc5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Assign the lead to the right team member as it arrives</li>\",\"text\":\"Assign the lead to the right team member as it arrives\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dc7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Keep the full history from first contact onward</li>\",\"text\":\"Keep the full history from first contact onward\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1dde\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Acquisitions</p>\",\"text\":\"Acquisitions\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1de0\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Work the seller, secure the property</h3>\",\"text\":\"Work the seller, secure the property\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1de2\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Your acquisitions team negotiates terms and gets the property under contract, with offers, follow-ups and documents tracked against the deal.</p>\",\"text\":\"Your acquisitions team negotiates terms and gets the property under contract, with offers, follow-ups and documents tracked against the deal.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1de4\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Track negotiations and offers in one view</li>\",\"text\":\"Track negotiations and offers in one view\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1de6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Set reminders for follow-ups and decision dates</li>\",\"text\":\"Set reminders for follow-ups and decision dates\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1de8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Keep property details and documents with the deal</li>\",\"text\":\"Keep property details and documents with the deal\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e03\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Nurture</p>\",\"text\":\"Nurture\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e05\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Backup for your acquisitions team</h3>\",\"text\":\"Backup for your acquisitions team\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e07\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">When a seller goes quiet or is not ready, Nurture steps in behind your acquisition managers. Drip campaigns over SMS and email, matched to why the deal stalled, keep working the lead until it comes back to life.</p>\",\"text\":\"When a seller goes quiet or is not ready, Nurture steps in behind your acquisition managers. Drip campaigns over SMS and email, matched to why the deal stalled, keep working the lead until it comes back to life.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e09\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Takes stalled leads off your closers' plates</li>\",\"text\":\"Takes stalled leads off your closers' plates\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e0b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Situational, timed and AI-tailored nurtures, in English and Spanish</li>\",\"text\":\"Situational, timed and AI-tailored nurtures, in English and Spanish\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e0d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Hands revived leads back to acquisitions to close</li>\",\"text\":\"Hands revived leads back to acquisitions to close\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e26\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Dispositions</p>\",\"text\":\"Dispositions\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e28\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Market and sell the deal</h3>\",\"text\":\"Market and sell the deal\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e2a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Once a property is under contract, the dispositions pipeline covers marketing to agents, investors and buyers, showings, offers and the buyer agreement.</p>\",\"text\":\"Once a property is under contract, the dispositions pipeline covers marketing to agents, investors and buyers, showings, offers and the buyer agreement.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e2c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Send listings to your investor network</li>\",\"text\":\"Send listings to your investor network\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e2e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Track incoming offers and counteroffers</li>\",\"text\":\"Track incoming offers and counteroffers\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e30\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Schedule showings and log feedback</li>\",\"text\":\"Schedule showings and log feedback\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e4b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Transaction Coordination</p>\",\"text\":\"Transaction Coordination\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e4d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>From contract to close</h3>\",\"text\":\"From contract to close\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e4f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Contracts, documents, payoffs and timelines are tracked through closing, with tasks assigned to the people responsible and documents signed inside the platform.</p>\",\"text\":\"Contracts, documents, payoffs and timelines are tracked through closing, with tasks assigned to the people responsible and documents signed inside the platform.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e51\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Send contracts for e-signature without leaving the system</li>\",\"text\":\"Send contracts for e-signature without leaving the system\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e53\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Follow closing timelines and pending items</li>\",\"text\":\"Follow closing timelines and pending items\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e55\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Keep every document linked to its deal</li>\",\"text\":\"Keep every document linked to its deal\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e76\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Contractors &amp; Vendors</p>\",\"text\":\"Contractors & Vendors\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e78\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Repairs and vendor work, tracked</h3>\",\"text\":\"Repairs and vendor work, tracked\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e7a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">A dedicated pipeline for repairs, renovations and vendor tasks, tied to the deal or property the work belongs to.</p>\",\"text\":\"A dedicated pipeline for repairs, renovations and vendor tasks, tied to the deal or property the work belongs to.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e7c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Assign jobs and follow timelines</li>\",\"text\":\"Assign jobs and follow timelines\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e7e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Track expenses against project budgets</li>\",\"text\":\"Track expenses against project budgets\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e80\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Attach invoices, receipts and reports to each job</li>\",\"text\":\"Attach invoices, receipts and reports to each job\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e9d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Owned &amp; Rentals</p>\",\"text\":\"Owned & Rentals\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1e9f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>The portfolio you keep</h3>\",\"text\":\"The portfolio you keep\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1ea1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Vacant properties, active rentals, tenants, lease dates and income are managed in a rentals pipeline that reports into the same KPI tracking.</p>\",\"text\":\"Vacant properties, active rentals, tenants, lease dates and income are managed in a rentals pipeline that reports into the same KPI tracking.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1ea3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Track rental income and expenses per property</li>\",\"text\":\"Track rental income and expenses per property\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1ea5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Follow lease start and end dates</li>\",\"text\":\"Follow lease start and end dates\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1ea7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<li>Keep tenant communication and lease documents together</li>\",\"text\":\"Keep tenant communication and lease documents together\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"7c6374db-f996-4d24-c463-7505b11d1ec3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note u-mt-16\\\">Your pipelines are configured to how your business runs. Routes shown are common examples, not a fixed sequence.</p>\",\"text\":\"Your pipelines are configured to how your business runs. Routes shown are common examples, not a fixed sequence.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7ede66\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Visibility that matters</p>\",\"text\":\"Visibility that matters\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7ede6b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>KPIs across <span class=\\\"hl-amber\\\" data-w-id=\\\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7ede69\\\">every pipeline</span>, not just the top of the funnel.</h2>\",\"text\":\"KPIs across every pipeline, not just the top of the funnel.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7ede6d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">KPI tracking is the reason the platform has its name. Because every pipeline lives in one system, the numbers describe the whole business.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI tracking is the reason the platform has its name. Because every pipeline lives in one system, the numbers describe the whole business.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeaa\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note u-mb-14\\\">Questions an owner or manager can answer</p>\",\"text\":\"Questions an owner or manager can answer\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeac\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Which lead sources turn into deals?</h3>\",\"text\":\"Which lead sources turn into deals?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeae\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Track lead sources through to contract, so marketing decisions follow results and not volume.</p>\",\"text\":\"Track lead sources through to contract, so marketing decisions follow results and not volume.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeb1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Where do deals slow down?</h3>\",\"text\":\"Where do deals slow down?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeb3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">See the stage where opportunities stall and spot underperforming areas before they become problems.</p>\",\"text\":\"See the stage where opportunities stall and spot underperforming areas before they become problems.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeb6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>How is each team performing?</h3>\",\"text\":\"How is each team performing?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edeb8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Review acquisitions, dispositions and coordination side by side, month over month.</p>\",\"text\":\"Review acquisitions, dispositions and coordination side by side, month over month.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edebb\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>What does the portfolio earn?</h3>\",\"text\":\"What does the portfolio earn?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"75f0f90c-0685-2785-0881-d8e83e7edebd\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Follow income and expenses for owned and rental properties in the same reporting.</p>\",\"text\":\"Follow income and expenses for owned and rental properties in the same reporting.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0979\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Three connected product areas</p>\",\"text\":\"Three connected product areas\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f097b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>An engine, nitro, and an optional extra driver.</h2>\",\"text\":\"An engine, nitro, and an optional extra driver.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f097d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">The CRM and AI Suite access come together in every Enterprise Optimization Suite. The AI Agent is a separate addition for teams that want it.</p>\",\"text\":\"The CRM and AI Suite access come together in every Enterprise Optimization Suite. The AI Agent is a separate addition for teams that want it.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0982\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>CRM</h3>\",\"text\":\"CRM\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0984\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">The engine of your operation</p>\",\"text\":\"The engine of your operation\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0986\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Contacts, conversations, pipelines, workflows and KPI tracking for every stage of the real estate business.</p>\",\"text\":\"Contacts, conversations, pipelines, workflows and KPI tracking for every stage of the real estate business.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0988\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa1f119ba75560d9c1652d\\\">Explore the CRM</a>\",\"text\":\"Explore the CRM\"},\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/services/crm\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f098b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"triad__join\\\">+</div>\",\"text\":\"+\"},\"attributes\":{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f098f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>AI Suite</h3>\",\"text\":\"AI Suite\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0991\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Nitro for the CRM engine</p>\",\"text\":\"Nitro for the CRM engine\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0993\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">A companion platform of nine AI tools for call capture, coaching, underwriting, data and forecasting. Optional, pay-as-you-go usage.</p>\",\"text\":\"A companion platform of nine AI tools for call capture, coaching, underwriting, data and forecasting. Optional, pay-as-you-go usage.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0995\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa6c72b8bbfbdd8948a38f\\\">Explore the AI Suite</a>\",\"text\":\"Explore the AI Suite\"},\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/services/ai-suite\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f0998\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"triad__join triad__join--opt\\\">optional</div>\",\"text\":\"optional\"},\"attributes\":{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f099c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>AI Agent</h3>\",\"text\":\"AI Agent\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f099e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Follow-up on your rules</p>\",\"text\":\"Follow-up on your rules\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f09a3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">A separate offering that follows up with new and older leads by voice, SMS, email and <span class=\\\"keep-case\\\" data-w-id=\\\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f09a1\\\">iMessage</span> within the guardrails you set.</p>\",\"text\":\"A separate offering that follows up with new and older leads by voice, SMS, email and iMessage within the guardrails you set.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f09a5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa191e7b59d3ca770d4e6a\\\">Explore the AI Agent</a>\",\"text\":\"Explore the AI Agent\"},\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/services/ai-agent\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f09b7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"u-mt-28\\\"><a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa6ce5a6769cca503f0934\\\" data-w-id=\\\"caaf69b0-c582-8407-655c-f347d65f09b6\\\">See how the offerings work</a></p>\",\"text\":\"See how the offerings work\"},\"attributes\":{}}],\"pagination\":{\"limit\":100,\"offset\":0,\"total\":222},\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-11-24T00:53:00.120Z\"}}"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "{\"label\":\"p1\",\"action\":\"get_page_content\",\"result\":{\"pageId\":\"68974c57cac027f80fdf8828\",\"nodes\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac716eb\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">The AI Suite <span class=\\\"badge badge--included\\\" data-w-id=\\\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac716ea\\\">Access included</span></p>\",\"text\":\"The AI Suite Access included\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac716f0\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>The AI Suite puts <span class=\\\"hl-green\\\" data-w-id=\\\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac716ee\\\">nitro</span> in the CRM engine.</h2>\",\"text\":\"The AI Suite puts nitro in the CRM engine.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac716f2\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Nine AI tools, supplied alongside your CRM, each built for a specific job in a real estate operation.</p>\",\"text\":\"Nine AI tools, supplied alongside your CRM, each built for a specific job in a real estate operation.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71710\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Capture &amp; Coach</h3>\",\"text\":\"Capture & Coach\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71712\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Every call makes your team better.</p>\",\"text\":\"Every call makes your team better.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71715\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">01</p>\",\"text\":\"01\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71717\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Notes Taker</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Notes Taker\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71719\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Captures call details, writes structured notes, fills the right fields and keeps the CRM record current.</p>\",\"text\":\"Captures call details, writes structured notes, fills the right fields and keeps the CRM record current.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7171c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">02</p>\",\"text\":\"02\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7171e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Sales Coach</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Sales Coach\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71720\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Scores calls for Lead and Acquisition Managers and reports strengths and weak spots daily, weekly and monthly.</p>\",\"text\":\"Scores calls for Lead and Acquisition Managers and reports strengths and weak spots daily, weekly and monthly.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71723\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">03</p>\",\"text\":\"03\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71725\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Training Coach</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Training Coach\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71727\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Practice across 10+ scenarios a day with feedback on communication, objection handling and conversion skills.</p>\",\"text\":\"Practice across 10+ scenarios a day with feedback on communication, objection handling and conversion skills.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7172e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Find &amp; Qualify</h3>\",\"text\":\"Find & Qualify\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71730\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Better data. Faster decisions.</p>\",\"text\":\"Better data. Faster decisions.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71733\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">04</p>\",\"text\":\"04\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71735\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Underwriting</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Underwriting\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71737\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Multi-source analysis with modes for however much data you have, photo-informed condition, and comps you can edit and rerun.</p>\",\"text\":\"Multi-source analysis with modes for however much data you have, photo-informed condition, and comps you can edit and rerun.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7173a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">05</p>\",\"text\":\"05\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7173c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Skiptracing</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Skiptracing\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7173e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Find phone numbers and emails from an address, an APN, or an address plus owner name, and DNC-check existing contacts.</p>\",\"text\":\"Find phone numbers and emails from an address, an APN, or an address plus owner name, and DNC-check existing contacts.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71741\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">06</p>\",\"text\":\"06\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71743\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Data Enrichment</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Data Enrichment\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71745\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Adds available property information to your CRM fields and shows exactly which fields changed.</p>\",\"text\":\"Adds available property information to your CRM fields and shows exactly which fields changed.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7174c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Know &amp; Grow</h3>\",\"text\":\"Know & Grow\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7174e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">See where the money is, and where it is leaking.</p>\",\"text\":\"See where the money is, and where it is leaking.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71751\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">07</p>\",\"text\":\"07\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71753\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Dashboard</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Dashboard\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71755\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Deeper KPI visibility across the business, plus a full accounting section.</p>\",\"text\":\"Deeper KPI visibility across the business, plus a full accounting section.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71758\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">08</p>\",\"text\":\"08\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7175a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Insights</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Insights\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7175c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Ask questions of your CRM and the Suite, and have it take supported actions and run routines.</p>\",\"text\":\"Ask questions of your CRM and the Suite, and have it take supported actions and run routines.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac7175f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">09</p>\",\"text\":\"09\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71761\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h4>AI Projections</h4>\",\"text\":\"AI Projections\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71763\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Forecast the months ahead from your KPIs, accounting and insights. Estimates, not guarantees.</p>\",\"text\":\"Forecast the months ahead from your KPIs, accounting and insights. Estimates, not guarantees.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70d6c734-75c6-59f6-2e36-8ea5aac71768\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--ghost\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa6c72b8bbfbdd8948a38f\\\">See every tool in detail</a>\",\"text\":\"See every tool in detail\"},\"attributes\":{\"data-label\":\"home suite all tools\",\"data-event\":\"product_explore\",\"href\":\"/services/ai-suite\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8fdf\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">A concrete workflow</p>\",\"text\":\"A concrete workflow\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8fe1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>One call. A clean record. A coaching note.</h2>\",\"text\":\"One call. A clean record. A coaching note.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8fe3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Two AI Suite tools work on the same conversation. AI Notes Taker keeps the CRM current, and AI Sales Coach tells the manager what to work on.</p>\",\"text\":\"Two AI Suite tools work on the same conversation. AI Notes Taker keeps the CRM current, and AI Sales Coach tells the manager what to work on.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ff2\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ff0\\\"></div>A seller call happens</h3>\",\"text\":\"A seller call happens\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ff7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ff5\\\">Seller</div>We inherited the house last spring. Roof needs work. We would like to be done by end of summer.</p>\",\"text\":\"SellerWe inherited the house last spring. Roof needs work. We would like to be done by end of summer.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ffc\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble bubble--me\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8ffa\\\">Acquisition manager</div>Understood. Is there a number you have in mind?</p>\",\"text\":\"Acquisition managerUnderstood. Is there a number you have in mind?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9001\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee8fff\\\">Seller</div>Somewhere around two-ten, if it is quick.</p>\",\"text\":\"SellerSomewhere around two-ten, if it is quick.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9003\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted u-text-sm\\\">Input: the recorded conversation.</p>\",\"text\":\"Input: the recorded conversation.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9008\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9006\\\"></div>AI Notes Taker updates the record</h3>\",\"text\":\"AI Notes Taker updates the record\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9015\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted u-text-sm\\\">Output: call details logged, the right fields filled, the CRM record updated without manual entry.</p>\",\"text\":\"Output: call details logged, the right fields filled, the CRM record updated without manual entry.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee901a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9018\\\"></div>AI Sales Coach scores the call</h3>\",\"text\":\"AI Sales Coach scores the call\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9037\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"coach\\\">Coaching note: the price came up before the repair costs were explored. Ask about the roof estimate first next time.</p>\",\"text\":\"Coaching note: the price came up before the repair costs were explored. Ask about the roof estimate first next time.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9039\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted u-text-sm\\\">Output: a scored call, with strengths and weak spots rolled into daily, weekly and monthly reports.</p>\",\"text\":\"Output: a scored call, with strengths and weak spots rolled into daily, weekly and monthly reports.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee9040\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"flow__foot\\\"><span class=\\\"note\\\" data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee903d\\\">Simulated preview · sample conversation and scores</span><span class=\\\"note\\\" data-w-id=\\\"64f2c5df-eb20-54b8-b182-7f32b2ee903f\\\">AI Suite · Notes Taker + Sales Coach</span></div>\",\"text\":\"Simulated preview · sample conversation and scoresAI Suite · Notes Taker + Sales Coach\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37de\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Optional AI Agent <span class=\\\"badge badge--optional\\\" data-w-id=\\\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37dd\\\">Separate offering</span></p>\",\"text\":\"Optional AI Agent Separate offering\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37e2\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>Follow-up that runs on <span class=\\\"hl-amber\\\" data-w-id=\\\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37e1\\\">your rules.</span></h2>\",\"text\":\"Follow-up that runs on your rules.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37e4\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">The AI Agent is a distinct addition for teams that want help with communication and follow-up. Set the guardrails once, and it decides when and how to follow up with new and older leads.</p>\",\"text\":\"The AI Agent is a distinct addition for teams that want help with communication and follow-up. Set the guardrails once, and it decides when and how to follow up with new and older leads.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37e6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--call\\\" href=\\\"tel:+17867868382\\\">Call the AI Agent · +1 786-786-8382</a>\",\"text\":\"Call the AI Agent · +1 786-786-8382\"},\"attributes\":{\"data-label\":\"home agent\",\"data-event\":\"agent_test_call_click\",\"href\":\"tel:+17867868382\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37e8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--ghost\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa191e7b59d3ca770d4e6a\\\">Explore the AI Agent</a>\",\"text\":\"Explore the AI Agent\"},\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/services/ai-agent\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37eb\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"note\\\">Test it yourself before you talk to us.</p>\",\"text\":\"Test it yourself before you talk to us.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37ee\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Channels</h3>\",\"text\":\"Channels\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37f3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">AI voice, SMS, email and <span class=\\\"keep-case\\\" data-w-id=\\\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37f1\\\">iMessage</span>.</p>\",\"text\":\"AI voice, SMS, email and iMessage.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37f6\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Leads</h3>\",\"text\":\"Leads\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37f8\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">New leads and older leads that deserve another look.</p>\",\"text\":\"New leads and older leads that deserve another look.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37fb\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Availability</h3>\",\"text\":\"Availability\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"bb303775-ce93-7a31-a82d-b6d421df37fd\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">With the Enterprise Optimization Suite + AI Agent. Not required for the CRM, the AI Suite or AI Nurture.</p>\",\"text\":\"With the Enterprise Optimization Suite + AI Agent. Not required for the CRM, the AI Suite or AI Nurture.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a71\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Real experience and R&amp;D</p>\",\"text\":\"Real experience and R&D\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a73\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>Engineered in the trenches of real estate investing.</h2>\",\"text\":\"Engineered in the trenches of real estate investing.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a75\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">KPI DRIVER was not created in a software lab. Over three years, our founders built and refined the processes, pipelines, KPI systems, drip campaigns and automations that ran their own investing business. That work became the platform.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER was not created in a software lab. Over three years, our founders built and refined the processes, pipelines, KPI systems, drip campaigns and automations that ran their own investing business. That work became the platform.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a78\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p><a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa188c23514ef7a01c1579\\\" data-w-id=\\\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a77\\\">Meet the team</a></p>\",\"text\":\"Meet the team\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a7b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Investor-led</h3>\",\"text\":\"Investor-led\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a7d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>CEO Brandy Pollack brings 30+ years in real estate investing to how the platform is shaped.</p>\",\"text\":\"CEO Brandy Pollack brings 30+ years in real estate investing to how the platform is shaped.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a80\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Built in-house</h3>\",\"text\":\"Built in-house\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a84\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Ahmed Ramy, our Chief Operations &amp; Technology Officer, leads development of the KPI tracking engine and the integrations around it.</p>\",\"text\":\"Ahmed Ramy, our Chief Operations & Technology Officer, leads development of the KPI tracking engine and the integrations around it.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a87\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Still building</h3>\",\"text\":\"Still building\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a89\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>The AI Suite is the latest chapter: nine tools shaped by the same day-to-day work as the CRM.</p>\",\"text\":\"The AI Suite is the latest chapter: nine tools shaped by the same day-to-day work as the CRM.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a8c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Used before shipped</h3>\",\"text\":\"Used before shipped\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"ee652b42-8b1c-a398-f53e-d110a3758a8e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Pipelines, drips and workflows come from an operating business, so they reflect how deals really move.</p>\",\"text\":\"Pipelines, drips and workflows come from an operating business, so they reflect how deals really move.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc40\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Customer success</p>\",\"text\":\"Customer success\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc45\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>AI for your pipeline. <span class=\\\"hl-green\\\" data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc43\\\">Real people</span> for your support.</h2>\",\"text\":\"AI for your pipeline. Real people for your support.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc47\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Support here is personal. No chatbots, no ticket numbers, no queue. Every client has a dedicated channel with our team, and we reply as soon as we can.</p>\",\"text\":\"Support here is personal. No chatbots, no ticket numbers, no queue. Every client has a dedicated channel with our team, and we reply as soon as we can.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc4f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"cc__bar\\\"><span class=\\\"cc__title\\\" data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc4c\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc4a\\\"></div>Your client channel</span><span class=\\\"badge badge--included\\\" data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc4e\\\">People, not bots</span></div>\",\"text\":\"Your client channelPeople, not bots\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc54\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc52\\\">Client</div>Can we add a Probate tag and a follow-up drip for it?</p>\",\"text\":\"ClientCan we add a Probate tag and a follow-up drip for it?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc59\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble bubble--me\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc57\\\">KPI DRIVER team</div>On it. Do you want the drip in English and Spanish?</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER teamOn it. Do you want the drip in English and Spanish?\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc5e\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc5c\\\">Client</div>Both, please.</p>\",\"text\":\"ClientBoth, please.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc63\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"bubble bubble--me\\\"><div data-w-id=\\\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc61\\\">KPI DRIVER team</div>Done. It is live in your Nurture pipeline. No charge.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER teamDone. It is live in your Nurture pipeline. No charge.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc68\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>A channel for every client</h3>\",\"text\":\"A channel for every client\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc6a\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">A direct line to the people who built your setup and know your account.</p>\",\"text\":\"A direct line to the people who built your setup and know your account.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc6d\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>No tickets. No bots.</h3>\",\"text\":\"No tickets. No bots.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc6f\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">You message us and a person on our team answers.</p>\",\"text\":\"You message us and a person on our team answers.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc72\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>Changes and edits at no extra cost</h3>\",\"text\":\"Changes and edits at no extra cost\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc74\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Adjustments that other providers bill for are part of the service. If a request is substantial, we send a quote before any work starts.</p>\",\"text\":\"Adjustments that other providers bill for are part of the service. If a request is substantial, we send a quote before any work starts.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc77\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3>On-demand walkthroughs</h3>\",\"text\":\"On-demand walkthroughs\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"3e2b4fc4-b2cd-8bb8-2420-c6a718f5bc79\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">A knowledge base of recorded walkthroughs inside the AI Suite covers the whole system, so anyone on your team can onboard at their own pace.</p>\",\"text\":\"A knowledge base of recorded walkthroughs inside the AI Suite covers the whole system, so anyone on your team can onboard at their own pace.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dcc\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Implementation and support</p>\",\"text\":\"Implementation and support\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dce\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>You will not be handed a login and left alone.</h2>\",\"text\":\"You will not be handed a login and left alone.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dd0\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Moving your business into a new system is real work. We do it with you. Most steps run in parallel, and a typical implementation is live in two to three weeks.</p>\",\"text\":\"Moving your business into a new system is real work. We do it with you. Most steps run in parallel, and a typical implementation is live in two to three weeks.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dd3\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Discovery call</h3>\",\"text\":\"Discovery call\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dd5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>We learn how your operation runs today and whether KPI DRIVER fits.</p>\",\"text\":\"We learn how your operation runs today and whether KPI DRIVER fits.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5dd9\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">CRM migration</h3>\",\"text\":\"CRM migration\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5ddb\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Your existing data moves across with a focus on keeping it intact. Scope and timing depend on your current system.</p>\",\"text\":\"Your existing data moves across with a focus on keeping it intact. Scope and timing depend on your current system.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5ddf\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Onboarding with a dedicated account manager</h3>\",\"text\":\"Onboarding with a dedicated account manager\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5de1\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Onboarding, training and strategy sessions with a named person who knows your account.</p>\",\"text\":\"Onboarding, training and strategy sessions with a named person who knows your account.\"},\"attributes\":{}}],\"pagination\":{\"limit\":100,\"offset\":100,\"total\":222},\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-11-24T00:53:00.120Z\"}}"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "{\"label\":\"p2\",\"action\":\"get_page_content\",\"result\":{\"pageId\":\"68974c57cac027f80fdf8828\",\"nodes\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5de5\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h3 class=\\\"kd-h4\\\">Ongoing support in your own channel</h3>\",\"text\":\"Ongoing support in your own channel\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"e4b6a195-39f1-0bcf-96f4-8071c20f5de7\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Training, changes and questions go straight to our team. The recorded walkthroughs in the AI Suite cover the rest on demand.</p>\",\"text\":\"Training, changes and questions go straight to our team. The recorded walkthroughs in the AI Suite cover the rest on demand.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d2536490\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Customer stories and reviews</p>\",\"text\":\"Customer stories and reviews\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d2536494\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>Watch what our clients are <span class=\\\"hl-green\\\" data-w-id=\\\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d2536493\\\">saying.</span></h2>\",\"text\":\"Watch what our clients are saying.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d2536496\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Investors and their teams, in their own words, plus unedited Google reviews.</p>\",\"text\":\"Investors and their teams, in their own words, plus unedited Google reviews.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d253649c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"reviews__fallback hud\\\">Client video stories play here. <a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@KPI_DRIVER\\\" data-w-id=\\\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d253649b\\\">Watch on our YouTube channel</a></p>\",\"text\":\"Client video stories play here. Watch on our YouTube channel\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d25364a2\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"reviews__fallback hud\\\">Live Google reviews load here from our reviews widget. <a class=\\\"link arrow\\\" href=\\\"https://share.google/vrTX65Bt5HdOu7jtQ\\\" data-w-id=\\\"c2020d3b-9c59-5bc6-1b3d-d170d25364a1\\\">Read them on Google</a></p>\",\"text\":\"Live Google reviews load here from our reviews widget. Read them on Google\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d67fe\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">FAQ</p>\",\"text\":\"FAQ\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6800\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2>Questions before the call</h2>\",\"text\":\"Questions before the call\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6805\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"muted\\\">Not covered here? <a class=\\\"link\\\" data-wf-link-page-id=\\\"6afa1e999eb44edc324f9215\\\" data-w-id=\\\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6803\\\">Send us a message</a>.</p>\",\"text\":\"Not covered here? Send us a message.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d680b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>KPI DRIVER is a real estate business operations platform built by investors for investors. Its CRM connects lead capture, nurture, acquisitions, dispositions, transaction coordination, contractors and vendors, and owned and rental properties, with KPI tracking across all of them.</p>\",\"text\":\"KPI DRIVER is a real estate business operations platform built by investors for investors. Its CRM connects lead capture, nurture, acquisitions, dispositions, transaction coordination, contractors and vendors, and owned and rental properties, with KPI tracking across all of them.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6813\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>The CRM and access to the AI Suite, together. There is no additional AI Suite subscription. Using the AI tools is optional, and you pay only for what you use.</p>\",\"text\":\"The CRM and access to the AI Suite, together. There is no additional AI Suite subscription. Using the AI tools is optional, and you pay only for what you use.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d681b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>No. The AI Agent is a separate, optional offering. Teams that want it choose the Enterprise Optimization Suite + AI Agent. You do not need the AI Agent to use the CRM or the AI Suite.</p>\",\"text\":\"No. The AI Agent is a separate, optional offering. Teams that want it choose the Enterprise Optimization Suite + AI Agent. You do not need the AI Agent to use the CRM or the AI Suite.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6823\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Pricing depends on your operation, so we cover it on a discovery call. Book a call and we will walk through fit, the two offerings, and how pay-as-you-go AI usage works.</p>\",\"text\":\"Pricing depends on your operation, so we cover it on a discovery call. Book a call and we will walk through fit, the two offerings, and how pay-as-you-go AI usage works.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d682b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>No. KPI DRIVER includes dedicated pipelines for each process, plus built-in document signature tools, so contracts stay attached to the deal they belong to.</p>\",\"text\":\"No. KPI DRIVER includes dedicated pipelines for each process, plus built-in document signature tools, so contracts stay attached to the deal they belong to.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6833\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Yes. KPI DRIVER is designed for both new and established real estate businesses. New teams start with a streamlined setup. Established teams work with us on data migration and pipelines that match how they already operate.</p>\",\"text\":\"Yes. KPI DRIVER is designed for both new and established real estate businesses. New teams start with a streamlined setup. Established teams work with us on data migration and pipelines that match how they already operate.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d683b\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Yes, and it is personal. Every client has a dedicated channel with our team and a dedicated account manager. There are no chatbots and no ticket queue, and we reply as soon as we can. Routine changes and edits are made at no extra cost. If a request is substantial, we send a quote first. A knowledge base of recorded walkthroughs inside the AI Suite covers the system on demand.</p>\",\"text\":\"Yes, and it is personal. Every client has a dedicated channel with our team and a dedicated account manager. There are no chatbots and no ticket queue, and we reply as soon as we can. Routine changes and edits are made at no extra cost. If a request is substantial, we send a quote first. A knowledge base of recorded walkthroughs inside the AI Suite covers the system on demand.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"70f81986-1a4f-f28d-7006-bfbd197d6843\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>Most steps run in parallel, and a typical implementation is live in two to three weeks. The timing depends on your data, your current system and how quickly approvals come back.</p>\",\"text\":\"Most steps run in parallel, and a typical implementation is live in two to three weeks. The timing depends on your data, your current system and how quickly approvals come back.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"892c22a6-7018-cde2-66ab-2bd3e5b4f787\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<h2 id=\\\"cta-h\\\">Make the <em data-w-id=\\\"892c22a6-7018-cde2-66ab-2bd3e5b4f786\\\">gear shift.</em></h2>\",\"text\":\"Make the gear shift.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"892c22a6-7018-cde2-66ab-2bd3e5b4f789\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<p>A discovery call is where we look at your operation, walk through the CRM and the AI Suite, and talk through fit and pricing.</p>\",\"text\":\"A discovery call is where we look at your operation, walk through the CRM and the AI Suite, and talk through fit and pricing.\"},\"attributes\":{}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"id\":\"892c22a6-7018-cde2-66ab-2bd3e5b4f78c\",\"text\":{\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"btn btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://link.kpidriver.com/widget/booking/9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\\\">Book a Discovery Call</a>\",\"text\":\"Book a Discovery Call\"},\"attributes\":{\"data-label\":\"cta band\",\"data-event\":\"discovery_call_click\",\"data-book\":\"9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\",\"rel\":\"noopener\",\"href\":\"https://link.kpidriver.com/widget/booking/9g3ccVyd2a9NsV51QuKN\"}},{\"type\":\"component-instance\",\"id\":\"a9f90edf-2a78-ae1c-60f5-f69c63a21781\",\"componentId\":\"a9ac0ddf-6026-8ce8-e2d5-ba87382680f1\",\"propertyOverrides\":[]}],\"pagination\":{\"limit\":100,\"offset\":200,\"total\":222},\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-11-24T00:53:00.120Z\"}}"
  },
  {
